WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.720
A five-joint arm reaches for a 4 centimetre cube.

2
00:00:05.436 --> 00:00:07.230
Grip at 2.7 seconds,

3
00:00:07.230 --> 00:00:09.224
with up to 16 newtons of finger

4
00:00:09.224 --> 00:00:12.307
force. The cube rises 8.1 centimetres.

5
00:00:12.484 --> 00:00:16.038
It is set down 0.2 centimetres from the target.

6
00:00:16.088 --> 00:00:17.233
Task passed.
